\code{HETDEL} by the other is in the union and not in the intersection.

\deqn{J = \frac{TP}{S + Q - TP}, \qquad D = \frac{2\,TP}{S + Q}}

where \eqn{S} and \eqn{Q} are the numbers of altered bins in the subject and
